    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mysterious Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Genetically modified insectoids are the product of an isolated top-secret research base.  As a consequence of experimentation, a mutation enabled the bugs to break captivity.  They began replicating exponentially and have annihilated the facility.  Your team has been dispatched to prepare the site for cleanup, an extermination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975350/extras/3ed74093882a960789e0e677da5c11ef.poster.avif?t=1730430213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975350/extras/3ed74093882a960789e0e677da5c11ef.webm?t=1730430213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975350/extras/3ed74093882a960789e0e677da5c11ef.mp4?t=1730430213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sandbox Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can play the game while spawning in explosive barrels, more enemies, teleporting around and regenerating your health.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975350/extras/0d116bc3c6b051d00d19abe4e91f6a40.poster.avif?t=1730430213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975350/extras/0d116bc3c6b051d00d19abe4e91f6a40.webm?t=1730430213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1975350/extras/0d116bc3c6b051d00d19abe4e91f6a40.mp4?t=1730430213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Detailed World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Destructible Walls</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Hazardous Machinery</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Climb Fences</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Door Crushing</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Red Explosive Barrels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-More to discover</p></li></ul>",
